## Reflection

This project expanded on the D Flip-Flop by storing 4 bits instead of a single one.

Understanding registers is important because they are fundamental components in processors, memory systems and digital communication.

## Problems

No major problems occurred during this project.

The main challenge was understanding vector signals (`[3:0]`) and how multiple bits can be stored and updated at the same time.

